8fa|n|One who boils. ; A vessel in which any thing is boiled. ; A strong metallic vessel, usually of wrought iron plates riveted together, or a composite structure variously formed, in which steam is generated for driving engines, or for heating, cooking, or other purposes.	N:1jdq,93,7~1jdq,93,7
